    6: Several premises need correcting first:
    7: 
    8: - **The supplied probe is already beyond the quoted 59-row instrument.** It contains the pass-4 nibble and coordinate additions. Statically expanding its loops gives **77 assertions in 17 sessions**: four earlier assertions were removed and 22 were added. [Colour probe](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/sgi_re_colourdefault_probe.py:451)
