   65: 
   66: Dataflow identifies dependencies. It does **not** establish that two samples exhaust the possible predicates over a dependency.
   67: 
   68: Under the strict body-partition rule:
   69: 
   70: - Arbitrary distinctions between valid tile indices are within-class slices.
   71: - Arbitrary distinctions between valid descriptor payloads are within-class slices.
