   98: TLB_A/depth-four/clear is supplied by the first coordinate decline. In the ordinary tiled sessions, depth one is first; the other depths run after it sets the latch. The linear-width session similarly puts depth one first. [Session ordering](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/sgi_re_colourdefault_probe.py:461)
